At the start of any website-audit task, follow the `agency-seo-ranker` skill
(`SKILL.md` in the same repo) and run `python scripts/seo_audit.py <target>`
for a baseline score. Run the 28-item checklist across 7 phases in order —
crawlability first, competition last. Score each item 0–3 (out of 84 total).
Return a scorecard table, prioritized fix list, and a 30-day improvement plan.
Read SKILL.md once per chat, not on every turn.
